From cb001046684cb2e367b7eac58f7d703b9fc80bb1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 08:23:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(contact): FAQ as a setlist and lyric sheet, no device

Replace the scene-launcher unit with an open composition set on the section's
graph paper: nine questions as songs in three sides that queue and play on the
next beat of a live 120 BPM clock; the answer is a lyric sheet that lights word
by word with a highlighter on the current word, a self-drawing scribble under
the playing title, a giant numeral that kicks on the beat, and a pointer lamp.
Reuses the tested playback engine; a queued launch now ends whatever is playing
and resets the stage.
